& [Problem]
  + the published ten-stage controller is an exact non-authorizing plan but has no independently replayable wrapper program pre-commission refusal form retrieval inventory or controller-level live-evidence verdict
  + directly authoring an SSH script without typed correspondence would let transport syntax and partial outputs silently become authority

& [Delineation]
  + inside is provider-free host-free compilation and verification of wrapper stages supplied preflight observations refusal evidence retrieval inventory and stopped-or-successful receipt correspondence
  + boundary is a later separately authorized invocation that may execute the already compiled stages exactly once
  + outside is current EVO-X2 contact provider observation archive transfer remote root creation installation execution retrieval cleanup retry policy mutation and autonomous work

& [DataDesign]
  + effect wrapper program binds controller request and plan digests exact stage order explicit execution boundary and one digest over the canonical body
  + every wrapper stage binds one controller ordinal kind required authority effect flag and a closed executor role rather than an ambient command string
  + remote-preflight record binds run request plan host outcome reason receipt expectation contact and effect counts; provider unavailable before commission is a refusal with no receipt
  + retrieval inventory binds the exact relative-path byte length and SHA256 set supplied to independent verification; it contains no paths outside the run evidence root
  + live-evidence verification has two closed branches: operational_refusal_before_commission_no_receipt or commissioned_receipt_verified

& [IndependentVerification]
  + refusal branch requires preflight refused provider_unavailable no commission admission no receipt no retrieved artifacts and zero remote calls provider requests and effects
  + commissioned branch requires admitted preflight exact commission receipt receipt-verification and audit artifacts plus reconstruction through the existing independent commission and receipt validators
  + raw-byte noncanonical duplicate unknown reordered missing substituted digest authority and outcome promotion cases refuse

& [ExecutionSafety]
  + the checked fixture and all tests set execution_authorized false and effects zero
  + no module in the provider-free semantic core may import filesystem process environment clock network SSH or SCP surfaces
  + executable effect orchestration remains behind the later live commission boundary and may consume only a published wrapper program that independently verifies against the published controller plan

& [Decision]
  + implement the pure typed wrapper and verifier first; do not claim or perform the live effect path in this turn unless a later publication bookend separately authorizes it
